---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = 'August 30, 2026';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="What this site collects, what it doesn't, and how advertising cookies are used."
>
  <article class="wrap prose about">
    <p class="eyebrow">cat privacy.log</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="dek">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <p>
      TheGEOLog (thegeolog.com) is operated by Mark Won. This page explains
      what information this site collects, how it's used, and the choices
      available.
    </p>

    <h2>What this site doesn't do</h2>
    <p>
      There are no user accounts, no comment system, and no forms that collect
      personal information. Reaching out is done by email, which is between
      you and the recipient — not stored or processed by this site.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      This site may use privacy-focused analytics (such as aggregate,
      non-identifying traffic metrics from its hosting provider) to understand
      which entries are read and how the site performs. These tools do not
      identify individual visitors.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising and cookies</h2>
    <p>
      This site may display advertising served by Google and other third-party
      advertising vendors. These vendors may use cookies — including the
      DoubleClick DART cookie — to serve ads based on a visitor's prior visits
      to this site or other sites on the web. Google's use of advertising
      cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visits to
      this site and/or other sites on the internet.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
      {' '}<a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Ads Settings</a>,
      or opt out of third-party vendor use of cookies for personalized
      advertising by visiting{' '}
      <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.aboutads.info</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party links</h2>
    <p>
      Entries on this site link to external tools, documentation, and
      sources. Those sites have their own privacy practices, which this
      policy doesn't cover.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      This policy may be updated as the site changes. The date at the top of
      this page reflects the most recent revision.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:hello@thegeolog.com">hello@thegeolog.com</a>
    </p>

    <div class="callout">
      <p class="eyebrow">note</p>
      <p>
        This is a standard, generic policy template covering the common case
        (a content site with no accounts, using analytics and Google-served
        ads). It is not legal advice. If this site later adds an email list,
        a comment system, or serves visitors from the EU/UK or California in
        volume, it's worth having this reviewed for GDPR/CCPA-specific
        disclosures at that point.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about { padding: 3rem 1.5rem 4rem; }
  .dek { color: var(--ink-faint); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: -0.5rem; }
</style>
